From 1fdc47d5bfd4387be0f883a19bee05bf26fe1559 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 02:32:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] Export the Auto as Java for the autokit library

generateAutoJava turns the auto section into the contract's class:
SOURCE, sorted ACTIONS and CONDITIONS, DRAWN_FOR, startPose, a mirroring
PoseFactory and build(). Paths reuse the stock exporter's model and
expressions; poses become p.of() locals, named points keep their names
where the heading allows, and lists holding a park card are wrapped in
kit.guarded with the park path's drive time.

The export menu gains "Export Auto (Java)", which downloads
<ClassName>.java or explains what blocks it, and
scripts/export-auto.mjs exports from the command line. A golden test
pins the hive-rush sample's output.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
